4. KERMANY CHEST X-RAY DATASET
------------------------------

The dataset used for training and evaluation is the paediatric chest X-ray
corpus associated with:

  M. Kermany, K. Zhang and M. Goldbaum,
  "Labeled Optical Coherence Tomography (OCT) and Chest X-Ray Images for
  Classification", Mendeley Data, V2, 2018.
  doi: 10.17632/rscbjw95tg.2

  * THE DATASET IS NOT BUNDLED WITH THIS REPOSITORY. Obtain it directly from
    its publisher and review the licence that applies to your use.
  * This repository includes only scripts that rearrange a local copy into the
    directory layout the code expects.
  * The dataset originates from Guangzhou Women and Children's Medical Center
    and contains images of identifiable paediatric patients that were released
    by their publisher for research use. Do not attempt to re-identify anyone,
    and do not use it for clinical purposes.
  * If you redistribute anything derived from the dataset, comply with the
    publisher's licence and attribution requirements at that time.


